WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:07.290
In order to save Mitsuki-sensei from his kidnapper, Hanon risked her life and went looking for Gaito's lair alone.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:11.660
Hippo thought that all of this was his fault, and he jumped right into the hands of the water demons.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.260
Our feelings are in tatters, and we're in big trouble.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.830
I wonder, what's this strange uneasiness I feel...

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:24.130
Could Kaito be in some kind of trouble?

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.980
Welcome back, my other self.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.470
Welcome to my castle.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.760
The Beat.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.450
I wonder, what's this uneasy feeling?

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:47.180
It's different from the feeling we felt from the water demons.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:48.850
Lucia!

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:50.010
Kaito?

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.680
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.680
Just now... I heard Kaito's voice just now.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.690
I didn't hear anything, though.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.020
Me neither.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.160
Could it be your imagination?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.160
I'm sure I heard Kaito's voice calling for me.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.570
Kaito.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:12.170
I hope nothing bad has happened to Kaito.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.450
Here you go, everyone. Let's drink some juice.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:22.210
If you keep wearing those long faces, you might break down.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.180
Let's lighten up.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.850
Here, Hippo.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.340
Hanon-san... you made some for me, too?

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.850
From now on, we have to work together to look for Gaito's lair.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:34.870
If you don't lighten up some, it'll be troubling for me.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:36.460
Hanon-san.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.140
Let's go, Sister Mimi.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.580
Okay, Sister Sheshe.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:09.330
Amazing! It feels like my body's overflowing with power.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.660
So these pearls can be used this way as well!

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.000
The power of our songs should have increased as well.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.700
Inhabitants of the deep! Come, gather around!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.040
Let's prepare for a lively Show Time!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.390
Huh?

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.380
We've found you, Black Beauty Sisters.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.330
How dare you betray Gaito-sama!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.230
I knew you two would someday show your true colors.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.830
Oh my. You finally figured it out?

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.290
Hey, you two!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.790
What on earth are you planning by betraying Gaito-sama!?

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:49.640
We aren't like you bunch, all tied down by your loyalty.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:56.440
Didn't you know? There's a mysterious woman named Sara in the castle, and she's bewitched Gaito.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.660
Now he no longer has the ambition to be ruler of the Panterassa.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.910
How true.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:03.660
Liar! How can there be such a woman?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.250
Stop with your nonsense!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.370
That's right!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.770
Are you two trying to insult Gaito-sama!?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.170
We won't be tricked by your weird excuses!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.550
You all sure are talking strangely.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:18.470
I don't have any reason to give you excuses.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.980
How true.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.710
Especially with you bunch of dimwits and dumbbells.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.970
What did you say!?

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:31.870
Oh, let's have them help out on our plan to capture the Mermaid Princesses, Sister Sheshe.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.870
Yes we should, Sister Mimi.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:37.330
It's not for Gaito, but for us.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.340
W-What's going on?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.130
There are so many deep-sea fishes!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.360
Deep Sea Flash!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.270
We've got two of the pearls here.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.640
Next, we'll capture those four Mermaid Princesses.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.370
And so, we're left with only one.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.680
We won't have to depend on Gaito at all, and yet we'll have gathered six of the pearls.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.640
That last pearl shouldn't take much effort to find.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.310
How true.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:07.240
We just have to gather the seven pearls.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:21.530
Mitsuki, no matter how long you continue to play the piano, we can't return to the past.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:24.800
Just like this hair, stained jet black.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:37.380
This tornado will soon crash onto land and smoke out the Mermaid Princesses!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.040
How true.

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.850
This is so exciting!

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.500
We've got breaking news.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:48.470
A tornado appeared suddenly near the gulf coast, where I'm at now.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.760
This tornado has really high winds and is heading toward the northeast.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.650
An evacuation notice has already been given out to the citizens near the gulf coast.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:58.700
I will report the extent of the damages when this tornado hits land in a short...

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:03.430
Mermaid Princesses, you can hear me, right?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.700
Black Beauty Sisters!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:11.340
She's sent a message through a frequency that only mermaids can hear.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:18.300
Mermaid Princesses, you must be tired of running away by slipping onto land, right?

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:24.020
We, the Black Beauty Sisters, will draw you all out now.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:30.690
If you continue to ignore this, high waves and tornadoes that you've never seen will hit the coastline cities.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.100
We aren't threatening you.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:39.120
In this case, if you Mermaid Princesses don't appear before noon, we'll massacre the people on land.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.380
Where am I?

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.680
Who are you!?

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.150
I am Gaito.

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.960
This is my castle.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:02.960
And you came to this place to seek power.

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:08.070
Yes, for the power to protect what's most precious to you.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:16.370
If you become one with me, you'll be able to obtain enormous power.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:19.540
Let go of me!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:26.220
How about it? Even if you haven't completely awakened yet, you should still have memories of it.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.590
T-That is...

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.630
This is the proof of a person holding the power of the Panterassa.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.730
Panterassa!? What's that?

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:45.510
Return to your true self.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.870
Playtime is now over.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.460
My other self.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.750
Please wait.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.640
Everyone, there's a response from the pearls around here.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.760
I applaud you for coming here and not running away.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.520
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.370
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.300
Green Pearl Voice!

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.270
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.050
Me, too!

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.820
Futile! It's futile!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.350
What?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.040
Those deep-sea fish are...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.810
What on earth are they planning?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:45.630
Could it be...

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:47.970
These fish are your fans.

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:50.080
Lucia, Hanon, Karen.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.880
Let's quickly Live Start.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.050
Damn! Just as I thought!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:57.410
I-It's blinding...

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.010
We won't be able to Live Start like this.

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.510
What kind of attack is this?

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.480
Of course.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:06.760
There are always those fans who interfere with a live show when it's overly exhilarating.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.950
Dark Lovers, finish them.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.420
Ice Breath!

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.060
Eat this!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:19.660
Go!

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:28.440
Yuuri-san. I might not able to fight you, but if it's the Black Beauty Sisters...

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.750
Damn. Where are they?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.450
Heavy Ice Breath!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:47.090
This is bothersome. Let's finish them with one blast, Sister Sheshe.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.620
Yes, you're right, Sister Mimi.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:53.500
Deep Sea Live! We call it "Live Snow Illusion!"

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:57.600
T-This is...

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.270
What exactly are those two planning!?

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.140
What's this?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.310
D-Damn...

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.550
W-We're trapped!?

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:09.800
What do we do!?

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:13.810
No good. Our powers can't break this ball of light.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.820
How is it? We prepared these special box seats just for you.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.490
Is it to your liking?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:24.630
We want to sing to our heart's content, so you'll have to stay there and listen attentively.

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.440
It's Show Time!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.080
How about some black temptation?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:59.860
You'll sleep in the depths of the sea, where sunlight can never reach.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.690
We'll take our time in taking your pearls.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.410
Not yet...

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.900
I can still fight...

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.420
I won't give in to the likes of them.

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:33.420
I am the guardian which protects the peace of the seas.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.240
Oh my, this is unexpected.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.630
He's still alive.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.930
Dark Lovers, finish him off.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.870
Yuuri-san...

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.200
I can't fight against Yuuri-san.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:53.250
But I can't walk away from my duty to protect the peace and hopes of the seas.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:00.150
This place is my castle. It's yours, too.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.570
Let's become one now.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:06.590
The world will belong to us alone when we become the ruler of the seven seas.

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.830
Lucia...

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:19.300
Are you still charmed by that Mermaid Princess, even with knowing you are Panterassa?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:23.720
But you should know, your feelings can never be returned.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:29.310
The feelings you have for that mermaid undermined by your fate.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.980
Don't just decide things by yourself...

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.050
Those feelings are not love.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.690
Brilliant Combination!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.130
Y-Yuuri-san! Please stop this!

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.310
YUURI-SAN!

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.670
H-Hippo-sama! Why...

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:58.620
Alright, alright.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.290
This is the end. You won't be able to bother us anymore.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.990
Hippo-sama! Hippo-sama!

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.920
Did I do this to you?

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.880
Oh my. So you two have that kind of a relationship.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:14.370
That was a surprise, Sister Sheshe.

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:16.260
I don't care about them.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.400
We have our jobs, to make storms on land.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:23.610
I may not be able to be together with Hippo-sama...

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:29.340
But, I won't let you destroy the land that recorded the beautiful memories of Hippo and me!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.010
Don't make us laugh.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.580
We don't care about your reason.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.580
Huh?

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:42.550
What happened to us?

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.220
Yuuri!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.360
E-Everyone...

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.030
Seems they've woken up.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.440
You've really taken us lightly!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.040
We're not to be toyed with!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.200
You've seriously made us mad.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.230
Even if you're angry, we aren't afraid one bit.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.380
How true.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.780
Ice Breath!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:08.980
Go! Eat this!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:11.720
Take this!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.300
There's still more!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.960
How about this!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.780
You really are fools.

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:30.000
Like those will hit us!

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:45.980
T-Those are the Mermaid Princess's pearls.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:49.080
Aqua... Regina-sama!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:01.970
Why is my pearl shining!?

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:10.370
Aqua... Regina-sama...

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:15.380
Mermaid Princesses. Danger has closed in.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:20.350
A new melody has been born under the resonance of the seven pearls.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.350
I shall bestow this song upon you.

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:37.030
I was looking forward to your arrival here.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:44.470
In past battles, Aqua Regina was afraid of Panterassa's power.

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:50.380
She sealed this power, and thus we were split in two.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:55.390
Because of that, I was unable to use all of my powers.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:56.850
But from today onwards, it'll be different.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.260
Remember your duty!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:03.760
You're my other self, and the descendant of the honorable Panterassa.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:07.200
You say that I'm on your side...

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.880
You're all just talk.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.540
How did you all escape!?

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.510
Don't tell me you broke our balls of light!?

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.920
WWe won't let you do whatever you like.

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:57.120
We'll save all the mermaids who have been captured by Gaito.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.880
Not just the seas, we will also protect the peace on land.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:04.530
We sing for the happiness of everyone.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.920
Pichi Pichi Voice, Live Start!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.930
T-This power is...

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.710
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.310
How about an encore?

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.440
We will be...

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:40.440
Gaito-sama!

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.690
Gaito-sama, save us!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.320
You're being annoying.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.700
Shut up.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.400
Save us!

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.470
Gaito-sama!

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:09.180
I don't know you.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.140
I am Doumoto Kaito!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.580
I am the child of musician parents!

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.200
I don't have any other identity!

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:22.130
Your duty is to capture the Mermaid Princesses and steal their pearls for Panterassa.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.580
I have to capture the mermaids?

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.600
There is no such thin-

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.950
You can't defy destiny.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:33.830
Why? Because you are my younger brother.

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:58.730
Come, step forth with me.

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:18.050
The world will belong to us alone when we become the ruler of the seven seas.

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:55.110
Lucia and the others have entered Gaito's lair to save Coco and me.

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:58.010
Come on, Coco. Let's escape with everyone else.

00:23:58.010 --> 00:23:59.370
I...

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:02.770
I don't deserve to receive their help.

00:24:02.770 --> 00:24:04.720
I... can't go.

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:05.990
Why?

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:08.330
I have always stayed by Sara's side.

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:11.030
But I couldn't stop her from going crazy.

00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:14.660
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:16.190
Darkness of the Heart.

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:17.610
I'm sorry, Sara.

00:24:17.610 --> 00:24:20.070
I'm sorry, everyone.
